<template><AppShell :title="membershipView?'我的会员':'我的成长'" back><view class="pad"><StateView :loading="loading&&!ready" :error="error" :count="ready?1:0" @retry="refresh" /><template v-if="ready&&!error"><template v-if="membershipView">
<view class="card membership-summary"><text class="muted tiny">当前会员状态</text><text class="membership-status">{{profile.membershipActive?'会员':'非会员'}}</text><text class="membership-note">{{profile.membershipActive?'会员有效期至 '+formatDate(profile.membershipExpiresAt):'当前为非会员'}}</text></view>
<view class="card"><text class="field-label">会员说明</text><text class="rule-copy">会员由平台授予，暂不开放购买，暂无额外交易权限。</text><text class="rule-copy">会员与成长等级分别记录。会员不能替代实名认证或店铺认证。</text><button class="ui-button btn outline wide section" :disabled="loading" @click="refresh">刷新会员状态</button></view>
</template><template v-else><view class="card growth-summary"><view class="row between"><text class="level">Lv.{{profile.level||1}}</text></view><text class="points">{{profile.growthPoints||0}}<text class="muted"> 成长值</text></text><text class="muted tiny">{{!profile.growthRulesReady?'等级规则尚未配置':profile.nextLevelPoints!=null?'距下一级还需 '+Math.max(0,profile.nextLevelPoints-profile.growthPoints)+' 成长值':'已达到当前最高等级'}}</text><view v-if="profile.growthProgress!=null" class="step-line section"><view :style="{width:Math.max(0,Math.min(100,Number(profile.growthProgress)||0))+'%'}" /></view></view><view class="card"><text class="field-label">成长规则</text><text class="rule-copy">成长值由平台按规则发放或调整，每笔都会记录原因。当前浏览、下单和付款不会自动增加成长值。</text><view v-if="thresholds.length" class="levels"><view v-for="(n,i) in thresholds" :key="i" class="level-row"><text>Lv.{{i+1}}</text><text>累计 {{n}} 成长值</text></view></view><text class="rule-copy">成长值与积分商城的积分分别计算，等级不能替代认证。</text></view><view class="card"><view class="row between"><text class="field-label">成长记录</text><button class="ui-button text-button" :disabled="loading" @click="refresh">刷新</button></view><text v-if="!items.length" class="rule-copy">暂无成长记录，获得成长值后会显示在这里。</text><view v-for="(item,i) in items" :key="i" class="growth-event"><view class="row between"><text class="event-reason">{{item.reason}}</text><text :class="['change',{positive:item.points>0}]">{{item.points>0?'+':''}}{{item.points}}</text></view><text class="muted tiny">{{formatDate(item.createdAt)}}</text></view><text v-if="moreError" class="field-error">{{moreError}}</text><button v-if="items.length<total" class="ui-button load-more" :disabled="loading" @click="more">{{loading?'加载中…':'加载更多'}}</button></view></template></template></view></AppShell></template>
<script setup>
import {ref,computed,watch} from 'vue';import {onLoad,onShow} from '@dcloudio/uni-app';import AppShell from '../../components/AppShell.vue';import StateView from '../../components/StateView.vue';import {session,request,loadMe,requireLogin} from '../../lib/api'
const membershipView=ref(false),profile=computed(()=>session.user?.playerProfile||{}),loading=ref(false),ready=ref(false),error=ref(''),moreError=ref(''),items=ref([]),total=ref(0),thresholds=ref([]);let version=0,page=1
const formatDate=v=>v?String(v).replace('T',' ').slice(0,16):'待更新'
onLoad(q=>{membershipView.value=q.section==='membership'})
watch(()=>session.token,()=>{version++;ready.value=false;loading.value=false;items.value=[];total.value=0;error.value='';moreError.value='';thresholds.value=[]},{flush:'sync'});onShow(()=>{if(requireLogin())refresh()})
async function refresh(){if(loading.value)return;const token=session.token,v=++version;loading.value=true;error.value='';moreError.value='';try{
 if(membershipView.value){await loadMe();if(token!==session.token||v!==version)return}
 else{const [,rules,data]=await Promise.all([loadMe(),request('/boost/me/growth/rules'),request('/boost/me/growth?page=1')]);if(token!==session.token||v!==version)return;thresholds.value=rules.thresholds?rules.thresholds.split(',').map(Number):[];items.value=data.items;total.value=data.total;page=1}
 ready.value=true
}catch(e){if(v===version)error.value=e.message}finally{if(v===version)loading.value=false}}
async function more(){if(loading.value)return;const token=session.token,v=version;loading.value=true;moreError.value='';try{const data=await request('/boost/me/growth?page='+(page+1));if(token!==session.token||v!==version)return;items.value.push(...data.items);total.value=data.total;page++}catch(e){if(v===version)moreError.value=e.message}finally{if(v===version)loading.value=false}}
</script>
<style scoped>.membership-summary{padding:22px;background:#fff9d7}.membership-status{display:block;font-size:28px;font-weight:750;margin-top:14px}.growth-summary{padding:22px;background:#fff9d7}.level{font-size:28px;font-weight:750}.points{display:block;font-size:30px;font-weight:700;margin:18px 0 8px}.points .muted{font-size:13px;font-weight:400}.membership-note{display:block;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px}.rule-copy{display:block;color:#666b78;line-height:1.8;font-size:13px;margin-top:14px}.levels{margin-top:16px}.level-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f1f3;font-size:14px}.growth-event{padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f1f3}.event-reason{flex:1;min-width:0;line-height:1.5;margin-right:14px;font-size:14px}.change{font-size:19px;font-weight:700}.positive{color:#12804a}.growth-event>.tiny{display:block;margin-top:8px}</style>
